ull, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T15:44:48Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "2. While writing the screenplay for Sense and Sensibility, X suffered every writer's worst nightmare. Her computer crashed, and the file containing her painstakingly crafted work seemingly vanished, replaced by \"funny shapes and hieroglyphs.\" In a state of pure panic and still wearing her nightgown, she hopped into a taxi and rushed the computer to the home of her Footlights comic trio British friend, Y.\nY, a known tech enthusiast, spent seven hours \"performing digital surgery\" to recover the corrupted file. When she eventually won the Oscar, Y joked that he should have at least gotten half the trophy for his IT support. X remains one of the few to win the Oscar for Best actress and best adapted screenplay and Y is a British legend. Id X and Y.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T15:44:58Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Fantastic set @⁨~AntNishu⁩ !! Such painstakingly written questions, lots of lurn and a fitting tribute to dalit history month!!", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T15:45:02Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Abe yaar iska naam kya hai", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T15:45:14Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Kangana and Amit Shah", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T15:45:14Z", "username": "Dhruv Nath", "text": "Bigelow?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T15:45:19Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "thompson", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-15T15:45:20Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "emma", "role": "chat", "is_c